<p><br><br>実家で飼ってるワンちゃん <img src="https://web.archive.org/web/20100214222500im_/http://stat.ameba.jp/blog/ucs/img/char/char2/003.gif" alt="わんわん" width="16" height="16" data-is-external-image="true"><br><br>名前は<span style="color: #0000ff;"><strong>トト♂<img loading="lazy" src="https://web.archive.org/web/20100214222500im_/http://stat.ameba.jp/blog/ucs/img/char/char2/089.gif" alt="ひらめき電球" width="16" height="16" data-is-external-image="true"><br></strong></span><br><br>僕の癒しです(●´ω｀●)ゞ<br><br><br><br><br></p>
