<p><br>ではまた<img loading="lazy" src="https://web.archive.org/web/20100214222500im_/http://stat.ameba.jp/blog/ucs/img/char/char2/105.gif" alt="チョキ" width="16" height="16" data-is-external-image="true"></p>
<br><br>
<p>☆まつざか　とおり☆彡</p>
