<figure class="post__image"><img loading="lazy"  src="https://eeewl1250.github.io/momo/media/posts/3/01.jpg" alt="" width="550" height="309" sizes="(max-width: 48em) 100vw, 768px" srcset="https://eeewl1250.github.io/momo/media/posts/3/responsive/01-xs.jpg 300w ,https://eeewl1250.github.io/momo/media/posts/3/responsive/01-sm.jpg 480w ,https://eeewl1250.github.io/momo/media/posts/3/responsive/01-md.jpg 768w ,https://eeewl1250.github.io/momo/media/posts/3/responsive/01-lg.jpg 1024w ,https://eeewl1250.github.io/momo/media/posts/3/responsive/01-xl.jpg 1360w ,https://eeewl1250.github.io/momo/media/posts/3/responsive/01-2xl.jpg 1600w"></figure>
